Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 06:46:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] srmech PAL resource-cleanup audit -- scanner + first scan
 results (#T1129)

Self-tested AST scanner (Python) + brace-bounded grep scanner (C) for the
mkdir/open-before-validate orphaned-resource class, generalised from
genome_save's rc431 seed defect. Both scanners ship positive+negative
controls that must pass before any zero is trusted. Findings and manual
triage continue on this branch; report follows in a subsequent commit.
